Title: The append-only ledger has no guard against losing an entry
Created: 2026-08-29
Author: Minh Ha-Duong
Closed: Won't do: Git history already preserves the append-only ledger, and a committed per-entry census would add maintenance machinery disproportionate to the residual merge-resolution risk.

